text = "DHAKA THEFT AUTO (DTA) — GOLD MASTER RELEASE

• Game Design & Engineering: Open-World Action Architecture
• Narrative & Cultural Consultant: Original Bangladesh Lore & Delta Cartel Narrative
• Audio Synthesis: 100% Original Synthesized Delta Soundscape & Soundtracks
• Engine: Godot Engine 4.x Forward+ / Jolt 3D Physics
• Platform: Windows PC 64-bit

Asset Licenses:
• All 3D meshes, custom PBR shaders, textures, character portraits, and audio files are 100% original, CC0, or procedurally synthesized specifically for this game release.
• No copyrighted external audio, textures, or code libraries were utilized."
autowrap_mode = 3

